      "width": 479.0399169921875,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "myyT60_-UncKxthWH6urU"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6628344,
      "version": 906,
      "versionNonce": 1978291937,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782897723498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V3 text_to_sql.py\n    go-server提供数据schema，以及数据库查询接口\n    调用LLM把用户问题转换成SQL\n    SQL做安全校验，当前只允许Select操作\n    调用go-server的查询接口\n    美化一下查询结果，回复\n    PS: 这套流程后续是要封装成tools再组装Agent的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V3 text_to_sql.py\n    go-server提供数据schema，以及数据库查询接口\n    调用LLM把用户问题转换成SQL\n    SQL做安全校验，当前只允许Select操作\n    调用go-server的查询接口\n    美化一下查询结果，回复\n    PS: 这套流程后续是要封装成tools再组装Agent的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eH4cv1yBMe6in6Lxhqxhl",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2121.4078725683553,
      "y": 1381.927520314413,
      "width": 781.4797973632812,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "myyT60_-UncKxthWH6urU"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1383079465,
      "version": 1171,
      "versionNonce": 1974715311,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782897723498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V4 function_agent.py\n    调通tools的使用，但本脚本只实现一次调用，第二次回复，共两轮LLM调用\n    其实很久以前就已经搞过了，但是当时OpenAI也是刚出Function Call\n    OpenAI-API文档/示例，模型能力，OpenAPI文档，Py构造执行命令/解析执行结果\n    等等各种因素，哪哪都差一点点，导致当时开发很不顺畅，每次调用工具都“开盲盒”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V4 function_agent.py\n    调通tools的使用，但本脚本只实现一次调用，第二次回复，共两轮LLM调用\n    其实很久以前就已经搞过了，但是当时OpenAI也是刚出Function Call\n    OpenAI-API文档/示例，模型能力，OpenAPI文档，Py构造执行命令/解析执行结果\n    等等各种因素，哪哪都差一点点，导致当时开发很不顺畅，每次调用工具都“开盲盒”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oi6cx_f4b0arhvm5IL9Ow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2137.169319008379,
      "y": 1595.41202681394,
      "width": 448.11993408203125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "myyT60_-UncKxthWH6urU"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1535749767,
      "version": 671,
      "versionNonce": 1126093505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782897723498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "V5 react_agent.py\n    虽然 LangChain 就有 create_react_agent\n    但是还是造轮子搞一个简单的 ReAct 循环试试",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V5 react_agent.py\n    虽然 LangChain 就有 create_react_agent\n    但是还是造轮子搞一个简单的 ReAct 循环试试",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QWwLeZfnZlotcLmMGZUBD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2689.5765485095994,
      "y": 577.8259819610373,
      "width": 468.2799072265625,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "myyT60_-UncKxthWH6urU"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1Y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 228310407,
      "version": 972,
      "versionNonce": 553481679,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782897723498,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "流式输出的控制器\n    一开始用简答的公式平滑输出速度效果不好\n    后来用PID算法控制打印的速度\n    总的来说就是\n        开始慢一点，像人类输出速度（活人感）\n        中间速度变化平滑（不跟随LLM-Steam突变）\n        但整体也会追上当前LLM输出进度\n    为什么选PID：纯粹以前玩过，拿来玩玩而已",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "流式输出的控制器\n    一开始用简答的公式平滑输出速度效果不好\n    后来用PID算法控制打印的速度\n    总的来说就是\n        开始慢一点，像人类输出速度（活人感）\n        中间速度变化平滑（不跟随LLM-Steam突变）\n        但整体也会追上当前LLM输出进度\n    为什么选PID：纯粹以前玩过，拿来玩玩而已",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
