      "isDeleted": false,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "V6 query_router.py\n    LangGraph 查询路由：根据问题自动分发到 SQL 或 RAG\n    START → classify(LLM分类) → [条件分支] → sql_query / rag_query → answer(汇聚) → END\n    sql_query: 调用 text_to_sql 链，结构化统计查询\n    rag_query: Chroma 向量检索 + LLM 语义回答\n    复用 V2 photo_rag + V3 text_to_sql，用 LangGraph StateGraph 编排",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "V6 query_router.py\n    LangGraph 查询路由：根据问题自动分发到 SQL 或 RAG\n    START → classify(LLM分类) → [条件分支] → sql_query / rag_query → answer(汇聚) → END\n    sql_query: 调用 text_to_sql 链，结构化统计查询\n    rag_query: Chroma 向量检索 + LLM 语义回答\n    复用 V2 photo_rag + V3 text_to_sql，用 LangGraph StateGraph 编排",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "seed": 1,
      "version": 202,
      "versionNonce": 184974543,
      "index": "b3M",
